#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:132
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: a person may have a picture of the whole page kept, sent by their browser extension or drawn here from the kept source with scripts and the network off. A picture taken in somebody's browser shows the page as they were seeing it, signed in or not. No, or not set: nobody's captures keep one."
msgstr ""
"Da: oseba lahko dobi shranjeno sliko cele strani, poslano z razširitvijo brskalnika ali narisano tu iz shranjenega vira, z izklopljenimi skripti in omrežjem. Slika, posneta v brskalniku nekoga, prikazuje stran, kot so jo videli, prijavljeni ali ne. Ne ali ni nastavljeno: zajemi nikogar je ne shranjujejo."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:123
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: a person may have the page's source kept beside what was read from it, exactly as it was parsed, so that a capture can be checked against it and read again by a better parser. It is kept as text and never shown as a page. No, or not set: nobody's captures keep it, whatever they have chosen."
msgstr ""
"Da: oseba lahko dobi shranjen vir strani ob tem, kar je bilo iz nje prebrano, natanko tako, kot je bil razčlenjen, da je zajem mogoče preveriti z njim in ga boljši razčlenjevalnik prebere znova. Shranjen je kot besedilo in nikoli prikazan kot stran. Ne ali ni nastavljeno: zajemi nikogar ga ne shranjujejo, karkoli so izbrali."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:70
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: anyone who finds the address may create an account. No: invitation only. An empty instance always offers the sign-up form, so somebody can become the first account."
msgstr ""
"Da: vsak, ki najde naslov, lahko ustvari račun. Ne: samo z vabilom. Prazna instanca vedno ponudi obrazec za registracijo, da lahko nekdo postane prvi račun."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:79
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: somebody who arrives through the identity provider is signed straight in, without being asked for a code as well. Say yes only if you know that provider checks identity at least as carefully as Postulo would. It never applies to a password sign-in, and it removes nobody's authenticator app. A passkey already counts on its own and needs no setting."
msgstr ""
"Da: kdor pride prek ponudnika identitete, se prijavi neposredno, ne da bi ga vprašali še za kodo. Odgovorite da le, če veste, da ta ponudnik preverja identiteto vsaj tako skrbno kot Postulo. Nikoli ne velja za prijavo z geslom in nikomur ne odstrani aplikacije za overjanje. Ključ za dostop že šteje sam zase in ne potrebuje nastavitve."

